WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
OD Hundred Lightning Kicks hits Juri as a Punish Counter.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:02.900
Chun-Li dashes toward the launched opponent.

3
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.500
Back heavy punch connects after the dash.

4
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:03.900
The Serenity Stream medium kick continues the juggle.

5
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.400
Heavy Tensho Kicks adds the final juggle hits.

6
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:06.900
Juri falls at the end of the conversion.
